        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CAREDN19, Eden Prairie Egg Knob with Carre Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Eden Prairie Knob with Carre Tall Plate has a traditional design that maintains a classic beauty. It is made out of solid brass and features Grandeur's dedication to high quality knobsets. The Carre Tall Plate with Eden Prairie Knob is easy to install. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-set-eden-prairie-knob-with-carre-tall-plate-grandeur-caredn19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Eden Prairie Knob with Carre Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Eden Prairie Egg Knob with 11 Inch Carre Escutcheon:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Tall Plate with Eden Prairie Knob Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CAREDN19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262392\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CAREDN19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
